#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Herní ovladač"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Provides support for using gamepads as input devices: pan, zoom and switch "
"panes, tabs and series items with a game controller."
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje používat herní ovladače jako vstupní zařízení: posouvání, "
"přibližování a přepínání podoken, karet a položek série pomocí herního "
"ovladače."

#. Translators: the horizontal (X) axis of the left stick of a game
#. controller; keep the letter X
#: src/config.rs:136
msgid "Left Stick X"
msgstr "Levá páčka X"

#. Translators: the vertical (Y) axis of the left stick
#: src/config.rs:138
msgid "Left Stick Y"
msgstr "Levá páčka Y"

#. Translators: the horizontal (X) axis of the right stick
#: src/config.rs:140
msgid "Right Stick X"
msgstr "Pravá páčka X"

#. Translators: the vertical (Y) axis of the right stick
#: src/config.rs:142
msgid "Right Stick Y"
msgstr "Pravá páčka Y"

#. Translators: the analog trigger under the left shoulder (LT, L2)
#: src/config.rs:144
msgid "Left Trigger"
msgstr "Levá spoušť"

#. Translators: the analog trigger under the right shoulder (RT, R2)
#: src/config.rs:146
msgid "Right Trigger"
msgstr "Pravá spoušť"

#. Translators: D-Pad is the directional pad, the cross of four
#. buttons on the left of a game controller
#: src/config.rs:149
msgid "D-Pad Left"
msgstr "Směrový kříž vlevo"

#: src/config.rs:150
msgid "D-Pad Right"
msgstr "Směrový kříž vpravo"

#: src/config.rs:151
msgid "D-Pad Up"
msgstr "Směrový kříž nahoru"

#: src/config.rs:152
msgid "D-Pad Down"
msgstr "Směrový kříž dolů"

#. Translators: the four face buttons are named by their position:
#. the bottom one (A on Xbox, Cross on PlayStation, B on Nintendo)
#: src/config.rs:155
msgid "South Button"
msgstr "Akční tlačítko dole"

#. Translators: the right face button (B on Xbox, Circle on PlayStation)
#: src/config.rs:157
msgid "East Button"
msgstr "Akční tlačítko vpravo"

#. Translators: the top face button (Y on Xbox, Triangle on PlayStation)
#: src/config.rs:159
msgid "North Button"
msgstr "Akční tlačítko nahoře"

#. Translators: the left face button (X on Xbox, Square on PlayStation)
#: src/config.rs:161
msgid "West Button"
msgstr "Akční tlačítko vlevo"

#. Translators: the left shoulder button, or bumper (LB, L1)
#: src/config.rs:163
msgid "Left Shoulder"
msgstr "Levé ramenní tlačítko"

#. Translators: the right shoulder button, or bumper (RB, R1)
#: src/config.rs:165
msgid "Right Shoulder"
msgstr "Pravé ramenní tlačítko"

#. Translators: pressing the left stick down like a button (LS, L3)
#: src/config.rs:167
msgid "Left Stick Click"
msgstr "Stisk levé páčky"

#. Translators: pressing the right stick down like a button (RS, R3)
#: src/config.rs:169
msgid "Right Stick Click"
msgstr "Stisk pravé páčky"

#. Translators: a control that does nothing
#: src/config.rs:293
msgid "Unassigned"
msgstr "Nepřiřazeno"

#. Translators: an action of a game controller; to pan is to move
#. the view of the slide sideways
#: src/config.rs:296
msgid "Pan Horizontally"
msgstr "Posunout vodorovně"

#: src/config.rs:297
msgid "Pan Vertically"
msgstr "Posunout svisle"

#. Translators: for a stick or trigger: pushing it up or to the
#. right zooms in, the other way zooms out
#: src/config.rs:300
msgid "Zoom (Up / Right Zooms In)"
msgstr "Přiblížení (nahoru / doprava přibližuje)"

#: src/config.rs:301
msgid "Zoom In"
msgstr "Přiblížit"

#: src/config.rs:302
msgid "Zoom Out"
msgstr "Oddálit"

#. Translators: moves the mouse pointer of the operating system
#: src/config.rs:304
msgid "Move Pointer Horizontally"
msgstr "Posunout ukazatel vodorovně"

#: src/config.rs:305
msgid "Move Pointer Vertically"
msgstr "Posunout ukazatel svisle"

#. Translators: a pane is one of the views side by side in eov
#: src/config.rs:307
msgid "Previous Pane"
msgstr "Předchozí podokno"

#: src/config.rs:308
msgid "Next Pane"
msgstr "Další podokno"

#: src/config.rs:309
msgid "Previous Tab"
msgstr "Předchozí karta"

#: src/config.rs:310
msgid "Next Tab"
msgstr "Další karta"

#. Translators: the series bar lists the slides of a series
#: src/config.rs:312
msgid "Toggle Series Bar"
msgstr "Zobrazit/skrýt panel série"

#: src/config.rs:313
msgid "Previous Series Item"
msgstr "Předchozí položka série"

#: src/config.rs:314
msgid "Next Series Item"
msgstr "Další položka série"

#: src/config.rs:315
msgid "Open Selected Series Item"
msgstr "Otevřít vybranou položku série"

#. Translators: fits the whole slide into the view
#: src/config.rs:317
msgid "Fit View"
msgstr "Přizpůsobit preparát podoknu"

#. Translators: this window is the gamepad settings window
#: src/config.rs:319
msgid "Show / Hide This Window"
msgstr "Zobrazit / skrýt toto okno"

#. Translators: turns gamepad input back on, or pauses it
#: src/config.rs:321
msgid "Enable / Pause"
msgstr "Povolit / pozastavit"

#. Translators: a dead zone is how far a stick may move before it
#. counts as input (it hides stick drift); shown in a narrow column
#: src/config.rs:459
msgid "Left Dead Zone"
msgstr "Levá mrtvá zóna"

#: src/config.rs:460
msgid "Right Dead Zone"
msgstr "Pravá mrtvá zóna"

#: src/config.rs:461
msgid "Trigger Dead Zone"
msgstr "Mrtvá zóna spouští"

#: src/config.rs:462
msgid "Pan Speed"
msgstr "Rychlost posunu"

#: src/config.rs:463
msgid "Zoom Speed"
msgstr "Rychlost přiblížení"

#. Translators: how input grows with the deflection of a stick: a
#. higher curve gives finer control near the centre
#: src/config.rs:466
msgid "Response Curve"
msgstr "Křivka odezvy"

#. Translators: the speed of the mouse pointer of the operating system
#: src/config.rs:468
msgid "Pointer Speed"
msgstr "Rychlost ukazatele"

#: src/config.rs:684
msgid "not a profile object"
msgstr "nejde o objekt profilu"

#. Translators: {} is the value of the "version" field of a profile
#: src/config.rs:694
msgid "ignoring the version {}"
msgstr "ignoruje se verze {}"

#. Translators: {key} is a field of a profile file, such as
#. 'pan_sensitivity'; {value} is what the field holds
#: src/config.rs:712
msgid "ignoring '{key}': {value} is not a number"
msgstr "ignoruje se „{key}“: {value} není číslo"

#. Translators: 'mappings' is a field of a profile file: keep the name
#: src/config.rs:730
msgid "ignoring 'mappings': not an object"
msgstr "ignoruje se „mappings“: nejde o objekt"

#: src/config.rs:745
msgid "the file is not a gamepad profile"
msgstr "soubor není profil herního ovladače"

#: src/config.rs:794
msgid "the stored gamepad settings are not an object"
msgstr "uložené nastavení herního ovladače není objekt"

#. Translators: {key} is a stored setting, such as 'enabled'; {error}
#. says why it cannot be read
#: src/config.rs:809
msgid "ignoring the stored '{key}': {error}"
msgstr "ignoruje se uložené „{key}“: {error}"

#. Translators: {} is a problem with the current settings (not a profile)
#: src/config.rs:840
msgid "settings: {}"
msgstr "nastavení: {}"

#: src/config.rs:843
msgid "ignoring the stored settings: {}"
msgstr "ignoruje se uložené nastavení: {}"

#: src/config.rs:854
msgid "ignoring the profile with the name {}"
msgstr "ignoruje se profil s názvem {}"

#: src/config.rs:859
msgid "ignoring the profile {name}: at most {n} profile is kept"
msgid_plural "ignoring the profile {name}: at most {n} profiles are kept"
msgstr[0] "ignoruje se profil {name}: uchovává se nejvýše {n} profil"
msgstr[1] "ignoruje se profil {name}: uchovávají se nejvýše {n} profily"
msgstr[2] "ignoruje se profil {name}: uchovává se nejvýše {n} profilů"

#. Translators: {name} is the name of a profile,
#. {problem} what is wrong with it
#: src/config.rs:873
msgid "{name}: {problem}"
msgstr "{name}: {problem}"

#. Translators: the name of a profile, then why it cannot be read
#: src/config.rs:881
msgid "ignoring the profile {}: {}"
msgstr "ignoruje se profil {}: {}"

#: src/config.rs:983
msgid "Enter a name for the profile."
msgstr "Zadejte název profilu."

#: src/config.rs:986
msgid "Profile names are limited to {n} character."
msgid_plural "Profile names are limited to {n} characters."
msgstr[0] "Název profilu může mít nejvýše {n} znak."
msgstr[1] "Název profilu může mít nejvýše {n} znaky."
msgstr[2] "Název profilu může mít nejvýše {n} znaků."

#: src/config.rs:991
msgid "Profile names cannot contain control characters."
msgstr "Název profilu nesmí obsahovat řídicí znaky."

#. Translators: the name given to a profile whose name would be empty
#: src/config.rs:1003
msgctxt "Profile name"
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

#. Translators: shown after the name of a controller; {level} is the
#. charge of its battery in percent
#: src/engine.rs:74
msgid "battery {level}%"
msgstr "baterie {level} %"

#. Translators: shown after the name of a controller; {level} is the
#. charge of its battery in percent
#: src/engine.rs:77
msgid "charging, {level}%"
msgstr "nabíjí se, {level} %"

#. Translators: shown after the name of a controller: its battery is full
#: src/engine.rs:79
msgid "charged"
msgstr "nabito"

#. Translators: {} is a folder of the system, such as /dev/input
#: src/environment.rs:88
msgid "{} is not available, so no controller can be opened."
msgstr "{} není k dispozici, takže nelze otevřít žádný ovladač."

#. Translators: udev is the Linux device manager and uaccess the name
#. of its tag: keep both
#: src/environment.rs:112
msgid ""
"A game controller is connected, but eov is not allowed to read it. udev "
"normally gives the logged-in user access to controllers (the uaccess tag); "
"if yours is not recognised as a joystick, add a udev rule that tags it with "
"uaccess, then reconnect it."
msgstr ""
"Je připojen herní ovladač, ale eov nemá oprávnění jej číst. udev obvykle "
"přihlášenému uživateli zpřístupní ovladače (značka uaccess); pokud váš "
"ovladač není rozpoznán jako joystick, přidejte pravidlo udev, které jej "
"označí značkou uaccess, a poté jej znovu připojte."

#. Translators: {command} is a command to type and {option} one of
#. its options: they stay as they are
#: src/environment.rs:124
msgid ""
"eov runs as a Flatpak without access to input devices. Allow it by running "
"{command} (Flatpak 1.15.6 or newer; older versions need {option}), then "
"restart eov."
msgstr ""
"eov běží jako Flatpak bez přístupu ke vstupním zařízením. Povolte jej "
"příkazem {command} (Flatpak 1.15.6 nebo novější; starší verze vyžadují "
"{option}) a poté eov restartujte."

#. Translators: the type of file in the file dialog
#: src/plugin.rs:91
msgid "Gamepad profile"
msgstr "Profil herního ovladače"

#. Translators: the tooltip of the toolbar button, and the title of
#. the gamepad settings window
#: src/plugin.rs:100 src/ui.rs:26
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Herní ovladač"

#: src/plugin.rs:108
msgid "the path has no file name"
msgstr "cesta neobsahuje název souboru"

#: src/plugin.rs:123
msgid "the file is too large to be a gamepad profile"
msgstr "soubor je příliš velký na to, aby šlo o profil herního ovladače"

#: src/plugin.rs:212
msgid "Cannot open the gamepad window"
msgstr "Okno herního ovladače nelze otevřít"

#. Translators: {} is the name of a profile
#: src/plugin.rs:272
msgid "The profile “{}” no longer exists."
msgstr "Profil „{}“ již neexistuje."

#. Translators: the name of a new profile when none was typed
#: src/plugin.rs:280
msgctxt "Profile name"
msgid "Untitled"
msgstr "Bez názvu"

#. Translators: {} is the name of a profile
#: src/plugin.rs:310
msgid ""
"A profile named “{}” already exists. Replace it with the default settings?"
msgstr "Profil s názvem „{}“ již existuje. Nahradit jej výchozím nastavením?"

#. Translators: {} is the name of a profile
#: src/plugin.rs:316
msgid ""
"A profile named “{}” already exists. Replace it with the current settings?"
msgstr "Profil s názvem „{}“ již existuje. Nahradit jej aktuálním nastavením?"

#: src/plugin.rs:321
msgid "Replace profile?"
msgstr "Nahradit profil?"

#. Translators: a button: replaces the profile
#: src/plugin.rs:324
msgid "Replace"
msgstr "Nahradit"

#: src/plugin.rs:325 src/plugin.rs:370
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Zrušit"

#: src/plugin.rs:338
msgid "You already have {n} profile. Delete one to save another."
msgid_plural "You already have {n} profiles. Delete one to save another."
msgstr[0] "Již máte {n} profil. Chcete-li uložit další, jeden smažte."
msgstr[1] "Již máte {n} profily. Chcete-li uložit další, jeden smažte."
msgstr[2] "Již máte {n} profilů. Chcete-li uložit další, jeden smažte."

#: src/plugin.rs:358
msgid "Choose a saved profile to delete."
msgstr "Zvolte uložený profil, který chcete smazat."

#: src/plugin.rs:362
msgid "Delete profile?"
msgstr "Smazat profil?"

#. Translators: {} is the name of a profile
#: src/plugin.rs:365
msgid "Delete the profile “{}”? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Smazat profil „{}“? Tuto akci nelze vrátit zpět."

#. Translators: a button: deletes the profile
#: src/plugin.rs:369
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Smazat"

#: src/plugin.rs:384
msgid "Import a gamepad profile"
msgstr "Import profilu herního ovladače"

#. Translators: the name of an exported profile when none is selected
#: src/plugin.rs:401
msgctxt "Profile name"
msgid "Gamepad profile"
msgstr "Profil herního ovladače"

#: src/plugin.rs:407
msgid "Export the gamepad profile"
msgstr "Export profilu herního ovladače"

#. Translators: {} is the path of a file
#: src/plugin.rs:465
msgid "Cannot import {}"
msgstr "{} nelze importovat"

#. Translators: the name of an imported profile when its file name
#. cannot be used
#: src/plugin.rs:478
msgctxt "Profile name"
msgid "Imported"
msgstr "Importovaný"

#. Translators: {} is the name of a profile
#: src/plugin.rs:496
msgid "Imported the profile “{}”"
msgstr "Profil „{}“ byl importován"

#: src/plugin.rs:502
msgid "You already have {n} profile. Delete one to import another."
msgid_plural "You already have {n} profiles. Delete one to import another."
msgstr[0] "Již máte {n} profil. Chcete-li importovat další, jeden smažte."
msgstr[1] "Již máte {n} profily. Chcete-li importovat další, jeden smažte."
msgstr[2] "Již máte {n} profilů. Chcete-li importovat další, jeden smažte."

#: src/plugin.rs:527
msgid "Cannot export the profile"
msgstr "Profil nelze exportovat"

#. Translators: {name} is the name of a profile, {path} a file
#: src/plugin.rs:536
msgid "Exported “{name}” to {path}"
msgstr "Profil „{name}“ byl exportován do {path}"

#. Translators: {} is the path of a file
#: src/plugin.rs:543
msgid "Cannot write {}"
msgstr "Nelze zapsat {}"

#: src/plugin.rs:640
msgid "Imported the gamepad settings of the previous plugin version"
msgstr ""
"Bylo importováno nastavení herního ovladače z předchozí verze zásuvného "
"modulu"

#: src/plugin.rs:642
msgid ""
"Imported the gamepad settings and {n} profile of the previous plugin version"
msgid_plural ""
"Imported the gamepad settings and {n} profiles of the previous plugin version"
msgstr[0] ""
"Bylo importováno nastavení herního ovladače a {n} profil z předchozí verze "
"zásuvného modulu"
msgstr[1] ""
"Bylo importováno nastavení herního ovladače a {n} profily z předchozí verze "
"zásuvného modulu"
msgstr[2] ""
"Bylo importováno nastavení herního ovladače a {n} profilů z předchozí verze "
"zásuvného modulu"

#: src/plugin.rs:653
msgid "Some gamepad settings could not be read and use their defaults"
msgstr ""
"Některá nastavení herního ovladače nelze načíst, a proto používají výchozí "
"hodnoty"

#. Translators: how eov moves the pointer on Wayland: the desktop portal for
#. remote desktop control; name it as Linux desktops in your language do
#: src/pointer.rs:44
msgid "Remote Desktop portal"
msgstr "portál Remote Desktop"

#. Translators: how eov moves the pointer on macOS and Windows
#: src/pointer.rs:46
msgid "system events"
msgstr "systémové události"

#. Translators: {} is the reason
#: src/pointer.rs:208
msgid "System pointer control was turned off: {}"
msgstr "Ovládání systémového ukazatele bylo vypnuto: {}"

#: src/pointer.rs:221
msgid "System pointer control is not available"
msgstr "Ovládání systémového ukazatele není k dispozici"

#. Translators: the Remote Desktop portal as in "Remote Desktop portal"; {} is the
#. portal's own error, often in English
#: src/pointer.rs:312
msgid "the Remote Desktop portal is not available ({})"
msgstr "portál Remote Desktop není k dispozici ({})"

#: src/pointer.rs:316
msgid "cannot create a portal session ({})"
msgstr "nelze vytvořit relaci portálu ({})"

#: src/pointer.rs:325
msgid "cannot request pointer access ({})"
msgstr "nelze požádat o přístup k ukazateli ({})"

#: src/pointer.rs:331
msgid "cannot start the portal session ({})"
msgstr "nelze spustit relaci portálu ({})"

#: src/pointer.rs:335
msgid "pointer access was declined"
msgstr "přístup k ukazateli byl odmítnut"

#: src/pointer.rs:338
msgid "pointer access was not granted ({})"
msgstr "přístup k ukazateli nebyl udělen ({})"

#: src/pointer.rs:342
msgid "pointer access was not granted"
msgstr "přístup k ukazateli nebyl udělen"

#: src/pointer.rs:361
msgid "no display server to send pointer motion to"
msgstr ""
"není k dispozici žádný zobrazovací server, kterému by bylo možné posílat "
"pohyb ukazatele"

#. Translators: System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility
#. is where macOS grants the permission: use the names macOS shows
#. in your language
#: src/pointer.rs:403
msgid ""
"allow eov under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility; eov "
"keeps trying"
msgstr ""
"povolte eov v Nastavení systému › Soukromí a zabezpečení › Zpřístupnění; eov "
"to bude dál zkoušet"

#: src/pointer.rs:424
msgid "not supported on this platform"
msgstr "na této platformě není podporováno"

#: src/shared.rs:267
msgid "Gamepad settings could not be saved"
msgstr "Nastavení herního ovladače nelze uložit"

#. Translators: a notification: what happened, then why
#: src/shared.rs:394
msgid "{message}: {detail}"
msgstr "{message}: {detail}"

#. Translators: the first entry of the list of profiles (changes are
#. then saved, but not to a profile)
#: src/ui.rs:94
msgid "No profile"
msgstr "Bez profilu"

#: src/ui.rs:156
msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "Spouštění…"

#. Translators: {} is the reason, from the system (often in English)
#: src/ui.rs:159
msgid "Controllers are unavailable: {}"
msgstr "Ovladače nejsou k dispozici: {}"

#. Translators: "Enable / Pause" is an action in the list of mappings
#: src/ui.rs:164
msgid ""
"Paused. Turn it on here or press the controller button mapped to Enable / "
"Pause."
msgstr ""
"Pozastaveno. Zapněte jej zde nebo stiskněte na ovladači tlačítko přiřazené "
"akci Povolit / pozastavit."

#: src/ui.rs:168
msgid "Waiting for a controller"
msgstr "Čekání na ovladač"

#: src/ui.rs:171
msgid "Ready. Input is ignored while eov is in the background."
msgstr "Připraveno. Vstup se ignoruje, když je eov na pozadí."

#. Translators: {} is the name of the controller in use
#: src/ui.rs:189
msgid "Ready: {}"
msgstr "Připraveno: {}"

#: src/ui.rs:191
msgid "Ready: {n} controller"
msgid_plural "Ready: {n} controllers"
msgstr[0] "Připraveno: {n} ovladač"
msgstr[1] "Připraveno: {n} ovladače"
msgstr[2] "Připraveno: {n} ovladačů"

#. Translators: {} is the reason, from the system (often in English)
#: src/ui.rs:203
msgid "The controller subsystem could not start: {}"
msgstr "Subsystém ovladačů nelze spustit: {}"

#: src/ui.rs:210
msgid "No controllers detected. Connect one by USB or Bluetooth."
msgstr ""
"Nebyly zjištěny žádné ovladače. Připojte ovladač přes USB nebo Bluetooth."

#: src/ui.rs:214
msgid "The chosen controller is not connected, so every controller is used."
msgstr "Zvolený ovladač není připojen, proto se používají všechny ovladače."

#: src/ui.rs:216
msgid "Every connected controller drives eov."
msgstr "eov ovládají všechny připojené ovladače."

#. Translators: "Move Pointer" stands for the actions "Move Pointer
#. Horizontally" and "Move Pointer Vertically" of the mappings
#: src/ui.rs:228
msgid ""
"Your mappings include Move Pointer. Turn this on to let them move the system "
"pointer while eov has focus."
msgstr ""
"Vaše přiřazení obsahují akci Posunout ukazatel. Zapněte tuto volbu, aby "
"mohla pohybovat systémovým ukazatelem, když je eov aktivní."

#. Translators: "Move Pointer" stands for the actions "Move Pointer
#. Horizontally" and "Move Pointer Vertically"; Remote Desktop and
#. Accessibility are the names of system permissions: write them as
#. the system shows them in your language
#: src/ui.rs:237
msgid ""
"Off. When on, Move Pointer mappings move the system pointer while eov has "
"focus. Wayland asks for Remote Desktop permission and macOS for "
"Accessibility access."
msgstr ""
"Vypnuto. Po zapnutí budou přiřazení akce Posunout ukazatel pohybovat "
"systémovým ukazatelem, když je eov aktivní. Wayland požádá o oprávnění ke "
"vzdálené ploše (Remote Desktop) a macOS o přístup ke Zpřístupnění."

#: src/ui.rs:246
msgid "On. Starts when a mapped stick moves."
msgstr "Zapnuto. Spustí se, jakmile se pohne přiřazená páčka."

#: src/ui.rs:248
msgid ""
"On. Starts when a mapped stick moves. Map a stick to Move Pointer to use it."
msgstr ""
"Zapnuto. Spustí se, jakmile se pohne přiřazená páčka. Chcete-li funkci "
"využít, přiřaďte páčce akci Posunout ukazatel."

